## Code Style

### Braces and Indentation
- Use braces for all control structures, even single-line
- Use 4 spaces for indentation (Unity default)
- Place opening brace on same line

### Spacing
```csharp
// ✅ GOOD: Consistent spacing
for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++)
{
    var n = cur + dirs[i];
    if (n.x < 0 || n.y < 0) continue;
}

// ✅ GOOD: Spacing around operators
Vector3 dir = (forward * mv.y + right * mv.x);
if (dir.sqrMagnitude > 1f) dir.Normalize();
```

### Comments
- Use XML documentation comments for public APIs
- Use inline comments sparingly, only when logic is complex
- Prefer self-documenting code over comments
